&#x017F;chaftlicher Grundlage</titlePart></docTitle><lb/>
<byline>von<lb/>
<hi rendition="#aq">Dr.</hi> <docAuthor><hi rendition="#fr">Adolf Mayer,</hi></docAuthor><lb/>
